    "description": {
      "value": "<blockquote><p>Command the Powers of Death and Undeath</p></blockquote><p>You explore the forces of life, death, and undeath. As a Necromancer, you learn to manipulate the energy that animates all creatures, and you draw ever more power from the forbidden secrets of your spellbook. Though many see Necromancers as menacing or villainous, not all of them are evil.</p><h3>Necromancer Features</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>Feature</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.3UQmWS8MZlX3CYDn]{Necromancy Savant}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.sDkDUn8WqGzz01BH]{Necromancy Spellbook}</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.AYRFc4JE3CmhRzQT]{Grave Power}</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.RhB6dBBTEGQAYC8g]{Undead Thralls}</td></tr><tr><td>10</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.VGetDJdjLpxRw2qQ]{Harvest Undead}</td></tr><tr><td>14</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.66J9A14TfOMYtI6b]{Death's Master}</td></tr></tbody></table>",
      "chat": ""
    },
